[{"id":"CN-NET-002","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["设备边界","分层"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/347ce4f2/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/347ce4f2/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>交换机、路由器、防火墙和应用服务分别主要改变哪种网络边界？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>交换机处理二层帧和广播域内转发，路由器处理三层下一跳，防火墙按策略限制流量，应用服务处理端口之上的协议语义。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>设备可能集成多种功能，回答时应按实际启用的转发、策略和终止行为描述，不要只按设备名称贴标签。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-locator-strict","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["Locator","严格模式"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(三)页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(三)页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>两个订单行都有“删除”按钮，哪种定位最合适？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先按业务身份缩小容器，再定位操作目标，可以消除歧义并保留测试意图。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>直接使用第一个删除按钮\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>使用全页面长 CSS 链\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>先定位目标订单行，再在行内定位删除按钮\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"playwright-trace-purpose","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["TraceViewer","调试"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十)调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十)调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8141684d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Trace Viewer 最适合回答什么问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>测试执行了什么，以及浏览器在每一步观察到什么。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Trace 将 Action、DOM 快照、网络、Console 和源码关联起来，适合重建失败因果；业务正确仍需明确断言和需求合同。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]